    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost there... Cecelia, do you know these streets?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... I've seen these houses before... but there's a lot of the same houses...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you just move here recently?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Move? I don't remember moving...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Mister Ezell, Mamma always took me outside at night. The roads look different in the dark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I like to sneak peeks out the window to see what it's like outside... so I think I can do it! I'll try...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay, Cecelia, we'll find it. We haven't reached the place I met you yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
