        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.9,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry... I was looking at the houses, I didn't see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Aren't you that girl who fainted and went to the hospital this morning? Are you alright now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's you! Um, she's... she's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, did anyone come looking for her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I stayed on watch until noon! But nobody showed up. It's strange. What are her parents up to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia says she lives right around here. You're sure you've never seen her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd definitely remember seeing such an adorable little girl! I suppose I don't need to stand around here worrying my head off anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, going to talk to the neighborhood hall isn't the worst idea. If her family's just moved in here, then they'll be sure to have records.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, lucky, that's Paula right there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seniora Paula! Over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, what's the matter? I'm running back to the hall right now, so let's walk and talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have we had any new households move in recently?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we have... but how recently are you talking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember roughly when you moved in, little miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ardent Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...didn't just move... been living here a really long time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Little lady, can I have your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Cecelia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... that doesn't make sense. I've been working here for over a decade. If you moved in a long time ago...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia, do you know your mama and papa's names?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma's name is... Feoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "!!!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha-Wh-What? Feoria, the one on Via Thervatius? Doesn't Feoria live alone? Where did she get a child as big as you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "But looking at you... you do bear a strong resemblance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's odd... illegitimate, really? Cecelia, when you say you've been living here long, you mean your mama?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you looking for your mama?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I want to find Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, then, senior, you must be... Feoria's relative or the like? Have you been fostering this girl out in the country? You've brought her to see her mother?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never saw this coming. No wonder she'd always avoid any introductions... Such a grown child, all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, senior? Um? Are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just about made it while we were talking. Feoria's house is right there. Should I knock on the door for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...7-265, Via Thervatius.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh, you know the address, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Intellectual Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell, what's wrong? That look on your face...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, Cecelia.... Let's get our\u2014you\u2014um, home for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "The name."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since finding Cecelia, the surprises have come so fast, it slipped my mind to even ask her 'what's your mama's name?'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The name..."
    },
    {
        "text": "An ill mother, white-clothed executor, people in gowns..."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do I tell Cecelia?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do I take her to find her mama, now?"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
