    },
    {
        "text": "You're a Liberi. Why are you out to abduct a Sankta girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_arrowshot",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a Liberi. Why are you PROTECTING a Sankta girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm protecting the Commandments of Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Commandments? When have the Sankta's commandments ever actually applied to Liberi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fiammetta, do you seriously believe Lateran Liberi are a part of Laterano?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What makes us not? I was born here. I grew up here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen. Do you know what you're even saying, Patia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who hasn't got it straight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Liberi living in Laterano all take the Lateran Commandments as guiding principles, we believe in the 'Lateran teachings', we see Sankta as... living miracles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Firearms, commandments, halos, empathy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suppose they're all Sankta miracles, sure! But do they have a single thing to do with Lateran Liberi?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do the Liberi have to believe in a miracle that will never, ever come to us?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of Laterano, all of the Lateran Church, belongs to nobody except the Sankta! Do you still not understand, Fiammetta?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you seriously believe you've become a part of them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
