        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you're not so staunch after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fiammetta, Fiammetta. Think it over, carefully, I'm begging you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you before I came from Iberia... do you know what it's like there? I can tell you, a lot of Iberians are even more devout than the Laterans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what did they get for it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people of Iberia have their fantasies of Laterano, thousands of miles away... That, I can understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why are the Lateran Liberi right there within reach, and still so delighted to give their lives for this bunch of Sankta partying about in their own closed-off golden age of forever?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why, Fiammetta?! Tell me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.7,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
