    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm wasting my breath, aren't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have your views, Patia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I have mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then tell me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Explain it! Why... would you rather chase something you know you'll never reach? Why aren't you willing to give even... one look behind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know what you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, is a smattering of words from me really going to change your mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If a someone's views are so easy to change, then they can't be worth that much to begin with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're only here to stall me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you know you can't hold me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We both have work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your companions are... practically no different from any civilian. Do you want them paying the price for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't, Patia. So get out of the way, and save us both the effort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
