    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did the lady just now say you actually knew our address?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia, do you recognize this firearm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this\u2014Mamma's guardian gun?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell... why do you have Mamma's gun...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Cecelia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry for what...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't really understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You know where Mamma is, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I do... I'm sorry, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... I don't know why I'm apologizing, either... I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia\u2014your mother\u2014passed away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not here anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If she's not here, where is she then? What does... 'passed away' mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember, this morning, Mamma said she was going somewhere, and she couldn't take me with her... Did you go there with her, Mister Ezell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you... take me there too? Just once, just for a little bit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014I won't be selfish, and I'll listen to Mamma, and I won't stay there and say I won't leave... so... so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you let me see Mamma one more time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't said goodbye to her yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
