    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, what's happening? Why is she crying, Ezell? Just what did you do to a poor little girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 200,
        "power": 5,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "power": 0,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you? Hold on, that uniform... You're a Legatus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very sharp eyes, Senior Ezell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "By order of His Holiness the Pope, I'm here to take Cecelia to the Basilica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "..................",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoops, forgot to introduce myself. My name's Oren Argiolas. If you want to check my identity, no harm in using your regulation terminal from the Hall there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no, forgot that too. You turned it off, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you find this place, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senior Ezell, you underestimate a Legatus. You thought your movements would be hard to track? Or did you think you were so thorough, you left zero trace along the way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Excellency... If you're going to take Cecelia away, can I at least ask you a few questions first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah, you're funny, senior. You think I have to answer what you ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not such a cruel man... so shoot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just who is Cecelia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was she... born a fallen angel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Colorful imagination, Ezell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not as mysterious as you think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia's mixed-blood, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? That's not possible... A Sankta's mixed-blood child can't be a Sankta!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are very few cases of Sankta mixing blood with other races... but it's not rare enough to alarm the Lateran Curia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know the reason perfectly well, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "Offspring of Sankta and other races don't become Sankta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sankta and Feline's child turns out Feline, a Sankta and Forte's child turns out Forte.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mixed Sankta offspring don't get their halo and wings of light when they say their first word, and they can't empathetically sense other Sankta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To put it simply, they won't have any of the Sankta's distinguishing features. Without exception...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the generally accepted wisdom, anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia is an exception.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a Sankta who shouldn't have turned out as one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My second question is, should Cecelia is taken to the Basilica, how the Lateran Curia will... treat her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me that look, Ezell. If I was going to lie to you, I'd feed you a much kinder one, no problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the reality's what you see. Cecelia is an 'exception.' I couldn't tell you how the Pope is going to handle this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this Holy Father of ours... I don't know what impression you have of him, but, well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, as I'm given to understand, he's not known to use extreme methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And look at how cute Cecelia is. How hardhearted would someone have to be to harm her, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Third question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I cannot entirely trust your answers... I wish to accompany Cecelia to the Basilica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, is that a question?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but that's the one 'question' you'll have to forgive my answer on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
